Package: nonbgfa
Type: Package
Title: Find Non-B DNA Forming Motifs in Genomic Sequences
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Duncan E.", "Donohue", role = c("aut"),
           comment = "Original GFA C implementation"),
    person("Jack R.", "Collins", role = "ctb",
           comment = "Original GFA C implementation"),
    person("ABCS-Frederick", role = "cph"))
Description: Identifies sequences associated with non-B DNA-forming motifs in
    FASTA-format genomic sequences. Detects seven motif classes: inverted
    repeats (cruciform DNA), mirror repeats (triplex DNA), direct repeats
    (slipped DNA), G-quadruplexes, Z-DNA, short tandem repeats (STR), and
    A-phased repeats (bent DNA). Based on the GFA suite developed at
    NCI-Frederick / Frederick National Laboratory for Biodefense and
    Counterterrorism. See <https://nonb-abcc.ncifcrf.gov/apps/site/default>.
